<title>FRANCE: Dexia to announce &quot;important&quot; deal.</title>
<headline>Dexia to announce &quot;important&quot; deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franco-Belgian bank Dexia said on Monday that its chairman Pierre Richard would announce &quot;an important financial operation&quot; at a news conference at 1600 GMT today at the bank's headquarters in Paris.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
